<title>FRANCE: Cyprus buys 25,000 tonnes barley - traders.</title>
<headline>Cyprus buys 25,000 tonnes barley - traders.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cyprus on Tuesday bought 25,000 tonnes of optional-origin barley at $163.50 per tonne including freight, for shipment between June 15 and June 30, European grain traders said.</p>
<p>It bought the barley at an international tender.</p>
</text>
